# New Character Cutscenes next to Three Paths (Port San d'Oria, Ulmia's path at status 2: 4) and Enter the Talekeeper
# (Bastok Mines from Zeruhn Mines at status 5: 176): zone-ins that run before the quest's. ROV off, notSeen 1 (a GM).
char zone=PortSanDoria pos=-80,-4,-20 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
setting ENABLE_ROV 0
login
mission Cop AncientFlamesBeckon completed # a GM
mission Cop ThreePaths current          # a GM
missionstatus Cop 2 pos=4               # a GM: Ulmia's path
charvar HQuest[newCharacterCS]notSeen 1 # a GM
warp -80,-4,-20 PortSanDoria            # Three Paths (4) wins
finish
